    "Motor Legal Expenses",
    "Protection if you're in an accident that isn't your fault, your case is likely to succeed (at least 51% chance of success) and your legal costs aren't covered elsewhere.",
    "You’ll get access to a free legal advice helpline – 24 hours a day, 365 days a year.",
    "We'll repay your excess for accidents caused by an uninsured driver",
    "Get up to £100,000 cover for legal expenses, so you know you’ve got a safety net.",
    "Policy limits and exclusions apply.",
    "We know it's stressful if you've had an accident, especially if it wasn't your fault.",
    "With our Motor Legal Expenses cover, you’ll get up to £100,000 to cover legal costs. This means you could claim back money you lost because of the accident.",
    "That could be for things like your excess, travel expenses or if you need to make a personal injury claim.",
    "It's an add-on to our car insurance or van insurance.",
    "We partner with Arc Legal for our Motor Legal Expenses cover.",
    "They're a specialist team who will manage your claim and will look after you every step of the way.",
    "We hope you don't need to - but if you do need to make a claim or raise a complaint, get in touch with them directly.",
    "Our Motor Legal Expenses cover can help with lots of different things.",
    "‘Uninsured losses’ means anything that isn't normally covered by your car or van insurance, or any costs you lose out on. That means things like:",
    "loss of earnings if you were out of work because of an injury",
    "the excess you had to pay on your original car or van insurance claim",
    "if you had belongings in your vehicle that were damaged in the accident, like your laptop",
    "the cost of public transport or other travel expenses if your vehicle is out of action",
    "You might have been hurt in the accident – whether it’s a fracture or life-changing injuries.",
    "That means you might want to make a personal injury claim against the driver who was at fault.",
    "If you do, we’ll help cover your legal costs. Find out more about our Personal Injury cover too.",
    "Want to know more? Remember, policy limits and exclusions apply. It's always best to check your policy documents to make sure you know exactly what is and isn't covered.",
    "Your guide to Motor Legal Expenses cover",
    "Insurance Product Information Document",
    "You have access to a free legal advice helpline with our Motor Legal Expenses cover. It’s available 24 hours a day, 365 days a year.",
    "One of Arc Legal’s expert team will talk you through any of the issues we’ve mentioned above and give you some handy advice.",
    "It's super easy. If you're buying car or van insurance for the first time, you can choose to add it when you get a quote.",
    "Or if you already have insurance with us, give us a call. We'll give you a quote and get it added to your cover!",
    "We offer lots of different add-ons, so you can tailor your car or van insurance to suit you and your needs.",
    "Learn more about our car insurance add-ons and how they can help.",
    "Take your van insurance to the next level with a range of optional add-ons.",
    "Do you need to make a car or van insurance claim, or want some legal advice? Find the numbers you need below.",
    "Call our claims line Call the legal helpline",
    "If you’ve been injured in an accident, you don’t have to get legal help right away. You can make a claim of up to £5,000 for free on the Official Injury Claim website.",
